    "public raster dimension and arithmetic boundaries on restore",
    "stable copied and frozen observations during asynchronous proposals",
    "original material position with unique direct owner and null subquestion adapter slot",
    "source branches:<revision> event key only after successful selected record",
    "blocking current unknown proposal on incomplete search",
    "active-level scheduling context during selected acquisition",
    "typed incomplete record converted before owner mutation into an unacquired full public transition",
    "subsequent returns in the same prefix retained without calling BranchRouting.record over an earlier acquisition gap",
    "terminal stop and resume without automatic acquisition retry or redispatch",
    "cold common acquisition, contrary effect, ablation, common-store restoration and current guards"
  ],
